    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47609" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
